---
import { INSTALL } from '../lib/version';
---
<div class="install">
  <code><span class="sh">$</span>{INSTALL}</code>
  <button type="button" data-copy={INSTALL} aria-label="Copy the install command">copy</button>
</div>
<p class="install-note">macOS. Puts <code>thc</code>, the Thought Control command, on your PATH, makes your first vault, starts the background daemon and sets up agent skills. Every download is checked before it's installed.</p>
